-- Subsection (b): "Upon the effective time of the filing in the office of the Secretary of State of the certificate of
-- revocation of dissolution or the certificate of restoration, the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration of the
-- corporation shall become effective and the corporation may again carry on its business."
-- src:1597 | (b) Upon the effective time of the filing in the office of the Secretary of State of the certificate of revocation of dissolution or the certificate of restoration, the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration of the corporation shall become effective and the corporation may again carry on its business.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 311(b) (src:1597)
GIVEN `the certificate has become effective in accordance with § 103` IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: section 103 (piece dg1)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 311(b) the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is effective and the corporation may again carry on its business` MEANS
    `the certificate has become effective in accordance with § 103`

-- Subsection (c): once effective, "the provisions of § 211(c) of this title shall govern, and the period of time the
-- corporation was in dissolution or was expired by limitation shall be included within the calculation of the 30-day
-- and 13-month periods to which § 211(c) of this title refers. An election of directors, however, may be held at the special
-- meeting of stockholders to which subsection (a) of this section refers, and in that event, that meeting of
-- stockholders shall be deemed an annual meeting of stockholders for purposes of § 211(c) of this title." Section 211(c)
-- is out of range (piece dg4); only what this subsection itself says is encoded.
-- src:1598 | (c) Upon the effectiveness of the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration of the corporation as provided in subsection (b) of this section, the provisions of § 211(c) of this title shall govern, and the period of time the corporation was in dissolution or was expired by limitation shall be included within the calculation of the 30-day and 13-month periods to which § 211(c) of this title refers. An election of directors, however, may be held at the special meeting of stockholders to which subsection (a) of this section refers, and in that event, that meeting of stockholders shall be deemed an annual meeting of stockholders for purposes of § 211(c) of this title.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 311(c) (src:1598)
GIVEN `the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is effective` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 311(c) the period the corporation was in dissolution or expired is included within the calculation of the periods to which section 211(c) refers` MEANS
    `the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is effective`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 311(c) (src:1598)
GIVEN `the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is effective` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an election of directors is held at the special meeting of stockholders to which subsection (a) refers` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 311(c) the special meeting of stockholders is deemed an annual meeting of stockholders for the purposes of section 211(c)` MEANS
    `the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is effective` AND `an election of directors is held at the special meeting of stockholders to which subsection (a) refers`

-- Subsection (d): if after the dissolution or expiration another corporation of this State has adopted the same name or
-- one "so nearly similar thereto as not to distinguish it from the corporation", or a foreign corporation has qualified to
-- do business in this State under such a name, "the corporation shall not be reinstated under the same name", but
-- under another name, and the certificate sets forth the name borne at the time and the new name.
-- src:1599 | (d) If after the dissolution became effective or after the expiration by limitation any other corporation organized under the laws of this State shall have adopted the same name as the corporation, or shall have adopted a name so nearly similar thereto as not to distinguish it from the corporation, or any foreign corporation shall have qualified to do business in this State under the same name as the corporation or under a name so nearly similar thereto as not to distinguish it from the corporation, then, in such case, the corporation shall not be reinstated under the same name which it bore when its dissolution became effective or it expired by limitation, but shall adopt and be reinstated or restored under some other name, and in such case the certificate to be filed under this section shall set forth the name borne by the corporation at the time its dissolution became effective or it expired by limitation and the new name under which the corporation is to be reinstated or restored.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 311(d) (src:1599)
GIVEN `since the dissolution became effective or the expiration, another corporation organized under the laws of this State has adopted the same name as the corporation, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it from the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `since the dissolution became effective or the expiration, a foreign corporation has qualified to do business in this State under the same name as the corporation, or under a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it from the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 311(d) the corporation must be reinstated or restored under another name` MEANS
        `since the dissolution became effective or the expiration, another corporation organized under the laws of this State has adopted the same name as the corporation, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it from the corporation`
    OR  `since the dissolution became effective or the expiration, a foreign corporation has qualified to do business in this State under the same name as the corporation, or under a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it from the corporation`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 311(d) (src:1599)
GIVEN `the corporation must be reinstated or restored under another name` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate sets forth the name borne by the corporation at the time its dissolution became effective or it expired by limitation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate sets forth the new name under which the corporation is to be reinstated or restored` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 311(d) the certificate sets forth the names the subsection requires` MEANS
    (NOT `the corporation must be reinstated or restored under another name`)
    OR (    `the certificate sets forth the name borne by the corporation at the time its dissolution became effective or it expired by limitation`
        AND `the certificate sets forth the new name under which the corporation is to be reinstated or restored`)

